# SUBJECTS WITH LOW AMPLITUDE TREMOR:
# REST TREMOR, CONDITION: DBS OFF, MEDICATION OFF (n=8 files)
#-----------------------------------------------------------
# SUBJ   FILE       RANGE VELOCITY LASER  RATE SAMPLES
# g9     g9rof.rit  0.5   mm/s     0-0.2  100  6354
# g10    g10rof.let 0.5   mm/s     0-0.2  100  6180
# g11    g11rof.let 0.1   mm/s     0-0.2  100  6306
# g12    g12rof.rit 0.2   mm/s     0-0.2  100  6360
